package codecdemo

// Regeneration of record for this package's `*.out.go` codecs (ADR-0042,
// `--target=anchor` because these DTOs bind to the anchor schema's membership
// registry rather than keelson's vdd).
//
// Each DTO file also carries the single-file invocation in its doc comment,
// which is what you want while iterating on one of them. This directive is the
// whole-package form `go generate ./...` sweeps, so `scripts/dev/generate.sh`
// covers these codecs instead of leaving them to be regenerated by hand — the
// gap that let them drift from the emitter (ADR-0146's Scope note).
//
// The nested/ subpackage carries its own directive.

//go:generate sh -c "go run -tags=\"$(cat ../../../../../tags)\" github.com/stergiotis/boxer/public/app keelsoncodec --target=anchor dronemission.go labeledtextdoc.go lineagedoc.go sensorreading.go textdoc.go"
